From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:59:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: DOM nodes and collections

removeNode, swapNode, replaceNode, insertBefore with an undefined or unknown
reference, nodeValue from any variant, IHTMLDOMNode3 prefix/localName/
isEqualNode/isSameNode/lookupNamespaceURI/lookupPrefix/isDefaultNamespace,
hasAttributes and normalize, CharacterData insertData/deleteData/replaceData/
substringData/length, attribute nodes (nodeType, siblings, ownerDocument),
attribute collections setNamedItem/removeNamedItem and removeAttributeNode,
enumerator Clone for childNodes and attributes, method-call access to
those collections, and element isDisabled, parentTextEdit, hideFocus,
canHaveHTML and readyStateValue.

